54
00:03:31.260 --> 00:03:35.260
Hey, look, this game is really cool.

55
00:03:35.260 --> 00:03:41.280
I didn't want to, I didn't want to interrupt them.

56
00:03:41.280 --> 00:03:42.200
I didn't want to interrupt them.

57
00:03:42.200 --> 00:03:44.810
So I'd stay out of it and let them have or form their

58
00:03:44.810 --> 00:03:49.250
