59
00:03:49.250 --> 00:03:53.260
And I loved seeing that.

60
00:03:53.260 --> 00:03:57.260
We also made a lot of new friends and connections.

61
00:03:57.260 --> 00:04:01.370
And honestly, the technical talent in Venezuela is

62
00:04:01.370 --> 00:04:02.260
